---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="About Us — Independent Bra Sizing Tools & Guides | BraSizeChecker"
  description="Learn about BraSizeChecker.com, our privacy-first local sizing calculator, and our mission to simplify bra sizing and fit education."
>
  <Header />
  <main class="flex-1 w-full max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-8 sm:py-12 md:py-16">
    <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-ink mb-6">About Us</h1>
    <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none text-body space-y-4 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base">
      <p>
        Welcome to BraSizeChecker! We are dedicated to helping people find their recommended bra size quickly and easily from the comfort of their homes.
      </p>
      <p>
        We understand that bra sizing can be confusing and inconsistent across different manufacturers. That's why we've built an easy-to-use <a href="/#calculator" class="text-primary font-medium hover:underline">bra size calculator</a>, comprehensive <a href="/#chart-section" class="text-primary font-medium hover:underline">international conversion charts</a>, and a simple <a href="/#how-to-measure" class="text-primary font-medium hover:underline">measurement guide</a> to establish your baseline starting size.
      </p>
      <p class="p-4 bg-canvas-soft-2 rounded-xl border border-hairline text-ink font-medium text-xs sm:text-sm">
        🔒 BraSizeChecker is designed to make sizing simple without requiring an account or storing your measurements.
      </p>
      <p>
        If you have any questions or suggestions, please feel free to reach out to us at <a href="mailto:ornacasa11@gmail.com" class="text-primary font-medium hover:underline">ornacasa11@gmail.com</a> or via our <a href="/contact" class="text-primary font-medium hover:underline">Contact Us</a> page.
      </p>
    </div>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
